      "writtenOn": "2022-12-23T21:11:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Why did you opt for this vs refactoring the test code?\n\n- First it\u0027s less code. Shorter code is easier to understand especially here. Take the example of the test `unsigned_image_does_not_have_public_key()`, the previous version spaned 15 lines and the current version has 2 lines + 2 lines setup in `bp`.\n- Second with less code the test focus is more clear. These tests are not about whether `avbtool` works, but if we generate the test data in the code we also need to maintain the `avbtool` calling details and check whether these commands succeed. As soong already handled this, why not let soong take this responsibility?\n(If one day people update vbmeta generation rule, soong is likely to get updated as well but no one will look into these tests. Frankly we don\u0027t care if the data is generated by `avbtool` or something else.)\n\nAbout the performance, it\u0027s true that soong can take a bit longer the first time, but the difference is not so noticeable. In general the test can take several ms more but we have something easier to maintain.",
      "parentUuid": "2f2ea060_bf6b2ce8",
